ns of procedures, not elsewhere classified</td><td>complication d'acte résiduelle ; l'échec de la circulation de Fontan n'y est pas décrit</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0073</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Épanchement péricardique</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower\" title=\"narrower\">maps to narrower concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">I31.3</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Pericardial effusion (noninflammatory)</td><td>épanchement non inflammatoire seulement</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0074</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Complication après transplantation cardiaque ou pulmonaire</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact\" title=\"inexact\">maps loosely to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">I97.9</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Postprocedural disorder of circulatory system, unspecified</td><td>les complications de greffe relèvent de T86</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0075</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Sténose acquise des veines pulmonaires</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">I28.8</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Other specified diseases of pulmonary vessels</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0076</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Obstruction d'une veine systémique</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact\" title=\"inexact\">maps loosely to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">I87.1</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Compression of vein</td><td>compression ≠ obstruction</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0077</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Collatérale(s) veino-veineuse(s) systémique(s)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact\" title=\"inexact\">maps loosely to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Q26.8</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Other congenital malformations of great veins</td><td>collatérales le plus souvent acquises après dérivation cavopulmonaire</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0078</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Artère(s) collatérale(s) systémico-pulmonaire(s) acquise(s)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">I77.8</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Other specified disorders of arteries and arterioles</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0079</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Fistules (malformations) artérioveineuses pulmonaires acquises</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">I28.0</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Arteriovenous fistula of pulmonary vessels</td><td>I28.0 exclut la forme congénitale (Q25.7)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0080</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Cardiomyopathie dilatée</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">I42.0</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Dilated cardiomyopathy</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0081</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Cardiomyopathie hypertrophique</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact\" title=\"inexact\">maps loosely to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">I42.2</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Other hypertrophic cardiomyopathy</td><td>la forme obstructive a son propre code (I42.1)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0082</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Cardiomyopathie hypertrophique obstructive du ventricule gauche</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">I42.1</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Obstructive hypertrophic cardiomyopathy</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0083</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Myocardite (cardiomyopathie inflammatoire)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">I51.4</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Myocarditis, unspecified</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0084</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Maladie de Kawasaki</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">M30.3</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Mucocutaneous lymph node syndrome [Kawasaki]</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0085</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Infarctus du myocarde</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower\" title=\"narrower\">maps to narrower concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">I21.9</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Acute myocardial infarction, unspecified</td><td>infarctus aigu seulement</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0086</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">État après transplantation cardiaque</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Z94.1</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Heart transplant status</td><td>statut de greffe cardiaque (ajouté v6.1) ; corrigé v6.1 — crossmap IPCCC : (vide) ; statut de greffe cardiaque (absent du crossmap)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0087</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Maladie vasculaire pulmonaire irréversible</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">I27.8</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Other specified pulmonary heart diseases</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0088</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Maladie vasculaire pulmonaire irréversible due à une cardiopathie congénitale (syndrome d'Eisenmenger)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">I27.8</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Other specified pulmonary heart diseases</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0089</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Trouble du rythme cardiaque</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">I49.9</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Cardiac arrhythmia, unspecified</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0090</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Fibrillation atriale</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">I48</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Atrial fibrillation and flutter</td><td>I48 regroupe fibrillation et flutter</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0091</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Flutter atrial</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">I48</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Atrial fibrillation and flutter</td><td>idem</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0092</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Trouble du rythme atrial</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact\" title=\"inexact\">maps loosely to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">I49.8</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Other specified cardiac arrhythmias</td><td>la fibrillation et le flutter sont codés en I48</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0093</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Trouble du rythme de la jonction atrioventriculaire</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact\" title=\"inexact\">maps loosely to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">I49.8</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Other specified cardiac arrhythmias</td><td>les tachycardies jonctionnelles sont codées en I47.1</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0094</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Trouble du rythme ventriculaire</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact\" title=\"inexact\">maps loosely to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">I49.8</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Other specified cardiac arrhythmias</td><td>la tachycardie ventriculaire est codée en I47.2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0095</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Tachycardie par réentrée atrioventriculaire avec préexcitation manifeste (Wolff-Parkinson-White)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">I45.6</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Pre-excitation syndrome</td><td>I45.6 couvre tous les syndromes de préexcitation</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0096</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Bloc atrioventriculaire</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact\" title=\"inexact\">maps loosely to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">I44.3</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Other and unspecified atrioventricular block</td><td>le BAV complet est codé en I44.2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0097</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Bloc atrioventriculaire complet acquis</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">I44.2</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Atrioventricular block, complete</td><td>ne précise pas l'origine acquise</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0098</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Indication de remplacement programmé d'un stimulateur cardiaque</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Z45.0</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Adjustment and management of cardiac devices</td><td>ajustement et entretien d'un dispositif cardiaque (corrigé v6.1) ; corrigé v6.1 — crossmap IPCCC : T82.9 ; remplacement programmé : ajustement d'un dispositif, pas une complication</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-style: none\">TAUSSIG-COND-0099</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px; border-bottom-style: none\">Entéropathie exsudative post-procédurale</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact\" title=\"inexact\">maps loosely to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">K90.4</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Malabsorption due to intolerance, not elsewhere classified</td><td>composante lésionnelle ; le concept exige aussi la cause externe</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-top-style: none\"/><td style=\"border-top-style: none; border-left-width: 0px\"/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact\" title=\"inexact\">maps loosely to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Y83.8</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Other surgical procedures</td><td>cause externe</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-style: none\">TAUSSIG-COND-0100</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px; border-bottom-style: none\">Bronchite plastique post-procédurale</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact\" title=\"inexact\">maps loosely to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">J98.0</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Diseases of bronchus, not elsewhere classified</td><td>composante lésionnelle</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-top-style: none\"/><td style=\"border-top-style: none; border-left-width: 0px\"/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact\" title=\"inexact\">maps loosely to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">J95.8</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Other postprocedural respiratory disorders</td><td>composante post-procédurale</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0101</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Chylothorax</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">J94.0</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Chylous effusion</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0102</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Embolisation d'un dispositif lors d'un cathétérisme cardiaque antérieur</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">T82.8</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Other specified complications of cardiac and vascular prosthetic devices, implants and grafts</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0103</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Dysfonction d'un dispositif lors d'un cathétérisme cardiaque antérieur</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">T82.5</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Mechanical complication of other cardiac and vascular devices and implants</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-style: none\">TAUSSIG-COND-0104</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px; border-bottom-style: none\">Perforation d'une cavité ou d'un vaisseau lors d'un cathétérisme cardiaque antérieur</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">T81.2</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Accidental puncture and laceration during a procedure, not elsewhere classified</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-top-style: none\"/><td style=\"border-top-style: none; border-left-width: 0px\"/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact\" title=\"inexact\">maps loosely to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Y60.5</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">During heart catheterization</td><td>cause externe complémentaire</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0105</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Corps étranger intracardiaque post-procédural</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">T81.5</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Foreign body accidentally left in body cavity or operation wound following a procedure</td><td>corps étranger laissé après un acte (corrigé v6.1) ; corrigé v6.1 — crossmap IPCCC : T81.8 ; corps étranger laissé lors d'un acte</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0106</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Embolisation d'un dispositif introduit par cathéter (corps étranger intravasculaire)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">T82.8</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Other specified complications of cardiac and vascular prosthetic devices, implants and grafts</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0107</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Hémorragie post-procédurale</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">T81.0</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Haemorrhage and haematoma complicating a procedure, not elsewhere classified</td><td/></tr></table></div>"
  ] ;
